  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Skin Barrier</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Ceramide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dryness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A superfine, high-performance mist that hydrates and refreshes for a next-level glowy finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skincare Concerns:</strong> Dryness and Dullness</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation:</strong> Spray</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></strong>- Ectoin: Binds water molecules to the skin to keep it hydrated.</p><p>- Ceramide Trio (NP, AP, EOP): Moisturizes, smooths, and reinforces the skin’s natural barrier.</p><p>- Magnolia Extract: Antioxidant containing magnolol and honokiol that purifies and soothes skin.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p >-Glazing Mist is multipurpose so you can use it in many ways. Don’t forget to shake before use!</p><p><br></p><p>-Apply it in your skincare routine as the first step after cleansing and the last step after moisturizer.</p><p><br></p><p>-Use it under makeup as hydrating skin prep or on top of makeup for moisture and glow.</p><p><br></p><p>-Take it on the go and mist onto face whenever skin needs a refresh.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Ectoin: Binds water molecules to the skin to keep it hydrated.<br>-Ceramide Trio (NP, AP, EOP): Moisturizes, smooths, and reinforces the skin&rsquo;s natural barrier.<br>-Magnolia Extract: Antioxidant containing magnolol and honokiol that purifies and soothes skin.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, Isononyl Isononanoate, Polyglyceryl-10 Oleate, Propanediol, Glycerin, Panthenol, Ectoin, Beta-Glucan, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Magnolia Officinalis Bark Extract, Xanthan Gum, Phytosphingosine, Caprylyl Glycol, Cholesterol, Carbomer, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Citric Acid.<br><br>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Skin Barrier</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Ceramide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dryness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A superfine, high-performance mist that hydrates and refreshes for a next-level glowy finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skincare Concerns:</strong> Dryness and Dullness</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation:</strong> Spray</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></strong>- Ectoin: Binds water molecules to the skin to keep it hydrated.</p><p>- Ceramide Trio (NP, AP, EOP): Moisturizes, smooths, and reinforces the skin’s natural barrier.</p><p>- Magnolia Extract: Antioxidant containing magnolol and honokiol that purifies and soothes skin.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p >-Glazing Mist is multipurpose so you can use it in many ways. Don’t forget to shake before use!</p><p><br></p><p>-Apply it in your skincare routine as the first step after cleansing and the last step after moisturizer.</p><p><br></p><p>-Use it under makeup as hydrating skin prep or on top of makeup for moisture and glow.</p><p><br></p><p>-Take it on the go and mist onto face whenever skin needs a refresh.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Ectoin: Binds water molecules to the skin to keep it hydrated.<br>-Ceramide Trio (NP, AP, EOP): Moisturizes, smooths, and reinforces the skin&rsquo;s natural barrier.<br>-Magnolia Extract: Antioxidant containing magnolol and honokiol that purifies and soothes skin.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, Isononyl Isononanoate, Polyglyceryl-10 Oleate, Propanediol, Glycerin, Panthenol, Ectoin, Beta-Glucan, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Magnolia Officinalis Bark Extract, Xanthan Gum, Phytosphingosine, Caprylyl Glycol, Cholesterol, Carbomer, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Citric Acid.<br><br>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</div></details>",
